// Incremental builds: one object per module, reused while its key is unchanged.
//
// Port of: j3c/src/emit/incr.rs
// J3: Lock the cache dir with `io.flock` so two j3c runs don't race.
// J3: Contracts (wave 19, contracts-c3.md): signatures only; chunk A fills every `// STUB A`. Decisions:
//     keys are `j3.hash` `xxh3_64` (Rust: `DefaultHasher`), so an object or stamp written by one compiler never
//     matches the other; clang jobs are processes (`j3.proc.start` + `waitAny`, a job cap), never threads (the
//     Session arena is single-threaded); nothing written or put on the link line follows hash-map order
//     (objects link in module order).
// J3: Every `use` of the module is here (part files have none).
